  "html": "<div class=\"mw-body-content\" id=\"mw-content-text\">\n <div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"zh\">\n  <p>\n   <b>\n    暗星\n   </b>\n   可以指：\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    <span class=\"ilh-all\" data-foreign-title=\"Dark star (Newtonian mechanics)\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-orig-title=\"暗星 (牛頓力學)\">\n     <span class=\"ilh-page\">\n      <a class=\"new\" href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9A%97%E6%98%9F_(%E7%89%9B%E9%A0%93%E5%8A%9B%E5%AD%B8)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"暗星 (牛頓力學)（页面不存在）\">\n       暗星 (牛頓力學)\n      </a>\n     </span>\n     <span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\">\n      <span class=\"ilh-paren\">\n       （\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"ilh-lang\">\n       英语\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"ilh-colon\">\n       ：\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"ilh-link\">\n       <a class=\"extiw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dark_star_(Newtonian_mechanics)\" title=\"en:Dark star (Newtonian mechanics)\">\n        <span dir=\"auto\" lang=\"en\">\n         Dark star (Newtonian mechanics)\n        </span>\n       </a>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"ilh-paren\">\n       ）\n      </span>\n     </span>\n    </span>\n    ，牛頓力學下引力強到光都無法逃離的天體\n    <ul>\n     <li>\n      <a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BB%91%E6%B4%9E\" title=\"黑洞\">\n       黑洞\n      </a>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E6%98%9F_(%E6%9A%97%E7%89%A9%E8%B3%AA)\" title=\"暗星 (暗物質)\">\n     暗星 (暗物質)\n    </a>\n    ，由於內部暗物質粒子的湮滅而被加熱的恒星\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%98%9F\" title=\"暗能量星\">\n     暗能量星\n    </a>\n    ，一种假想的由暗能量组成的替代黑洞的天體\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <table class=\"metadata plainlinks dmbox dmbox-disambig\" id=\"disambigbox\" style=\"\">\n   <tbody>\n    <tr>\n     <td class=\"mbox-image\" style=\"padding: 2px 0 2px 0.4em;\">\n      <span typeof=\"mw:File\">\n       <a class=\"mw-file-description\" href=\"/wiki/File:Disambig_gray.svg\">\n        <im